{"version":1,"content":"<p>自2026年初以來，微軟已多次採取措施改進Windows 11，但大多數用户實際體驗中的變化並不明顯。早在今年7月，微軟就承諾將為Windows 11帶來內存效率方面的提升。從目前的情況看，微軟實現這一目標的方式之一，是讓系統內置應用和後台服務變得更加高效。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588132.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.869674+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:01:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_hash":"50a6ad52811859f8eb668d38a803029931873d55a37107a9d71b449116339b2a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}